# The salt flats close up: its most characteristic ground from above and over
# the shoulder at noon, then at the pans the plan ruled across it, and at 19:00.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/lands_salt_close.tour --seed=7 --weather=clear:0
coast calm
hour 12
place typical_salt_flats
wait 3.0
shot salt-above with land:salt_flats
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
wait 1.0
shot salt-noon with land:salt_flats
place pans
wait 3.0
shot pans-noon
hour 19
wait 2.0
shot pans-golden
